      "source": "<a href=\"JsonSchemaObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>JsonSchemaObject</code></a> implementation of <code>type : 'boolean'</code> schema elements.<br/>\nProvides programmatic access to schema specifics via a fluent API producing immutable <a href=\"JsonSchemaObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>schema objects</code></a>.",
